Copyright 2012 The B612 Project Authors (https://github.com/polarsys/b612)

This file is a subset of b612_bold, made by "kerneltool vector_fonts" (docs/FONTS.md):
the characters 32 to 126 and the glyph .notdef, each glyph a simple glyph
(0 glyphs made of glyphs were made simple), no hinting instructions, no
OpenType layout tables; the 239 pair adjustments of its table kern between
these characters. The subset carries the name "B612 ASCII Bold".
License of the source: SIL OFL 1.1, no Reserved Font Name.

